Material Symbols variable fonts and codepoint tables
====================================================

Files:
- winia-material-symbols-outlined/src/font.ttf
- winia-material-symbols-rounded/src/font.ttf
- winia-material-symbols-sharp/src/font.ttf
- winia/src/icon/outlined.rs / rounded.rs / sharp.rs (generated codepoint constants)

The font files live in the winia-material-symbols-* crates so the main winia package
stays below crates.io's 10 MB limit.

Source: https://github.com/google/material-design-icons
License: Apache License 2.0
Copyright 2022 Google LLC

Variable font axis ranges (official):
  FILL 0..1, GRAD -50..200, opsz 20..48, wght 100..700
See https://developers.google.com/fonts/docs/material_symbols
